{"id":"alegri_a","lemma":"alegría","pos":"noun","rank":1437,"glosses":["joy, happiness","Any of various amaranths","Mexican candy made from amaranth seeds with honey or sugar"],"ipa":"/aleˈɡɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"alegrías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-alegr%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él lloró de alegría.","en":"He cried for joy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734477"},{"text":"Esto me llena de alegría.","en":"This fills me with joy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152448"},{"text":"Su mirada expresaba su alegría.","en":"Her look expressed her joy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639618"},{"text":"Ella le recibió con alegría.","en":"She greeted him cheerfully.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514756"},{"text":"Mi corazón rebosa de alegría.","en":"My heart is filled with joy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741056"}]}